## Memory focus

The approximately 49 KB OBJ expands into tens of thousands of trace/cell/completion records. P5-TB11 observed about 80,862 trace segments, 21,298 arrangement cells, 21,297 completion patches, and 2,729 parity splits. This turn releases consumed production intermediates, moves expanded payloads, compacts ownership state, defers final output allocation, retains one rollback/one mutable candidate, and adds owned-byte diagnostics.

